OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with a band of
OL,6,Fheavy, potentially thundery showers
OL,7,Fmoving across the area. Rain will
OL,8,Fclear to the north during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with a mix of sunshine and
OL,10,Fshowers following. Staying warm and
OL,11,Fhumid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStarting mostly dry but heavy
OL,14,Frain moves into coastal areas for the
OL,15,Ffirst half of the night. These showers
OL,16,Fmove north, leaving clear spells for
OL,17,Fmany. Staying mild overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
