OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly dry start with bright
OL,6,Fspells. Heavy showers with the risk of
OL,7,Fthunder and hail develop into the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Another warm day expected.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAn
OL,11,Funsettled bank holiday weekend with
OL,12,Fshowers and possibly more thunder on
OL,13,Fthe way. Staying warm to start with
OL,14,Fbut turning fresher as winds shift to
OL,15,Fa westerly by Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
